<title>JAPAN: Nintendo to postpone sales of N64 disk/disk drives.</title>
<headline>Nintendo to postpone sales of N64 disk/disk drives.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nintendo Co Ltd said on Friday that it will postpone sales of special disks and disk drives for its Nintendo64 TV video game players to March 1998.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said Nintendo had originally planned to launch sales by the end of this year, but that it was forced to postpone the target because of a delay in developing the disks and disk drives, which have a larger memory capacity than the conventional type.</p>
</text>
